  "name": "Question 3",
  "problem": "Consider the finite region $D$ in the $xy$-plane enclosed by the curve $y=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4},$ and the lines $y=5-2x$ and $y=-\\frac{x}{3}.$ Express ${∬}_{D}f(x,y)\\,dA$ as a sum of repeated integrals over type II regions.",
